Package: oneplus-erhai-firmware
Version: 1.2
Architecture: arm64
Maintainer: TheMojoMan <themojoman@gmx.net>
Conflicts: linux-firmware
Replaces: linux-firmware
Description: Firmware blobs for OnePlus Pad 3 (erhai)
 OxygenOS 16.0.9.400 firmware for the OnePlus Pad 3 (erhai/SM8750):
 WCN7880 (peach) WLAN, BRAHMA Bluetooth, IPA, the ADSP split image
 (adsp.mdt + adsp_dtb.mdt) and, since 1.2, the CDSP split image
 (cdsp.mdt + cdsp.bNN + cdsp_dtb.mdt + cdsp_dtb.bNN) that hosts the
 Hexagon NPU (HTP) and is the prerequisite for FastRPC on the compute
 DSP (/dev/fastrpc-cdsp).

